&lt;p&gt;Communicate clearly with technical and executive audiences, and can distill complex, multi-disciplinary programs into decisions and tradeoffs leadership can act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thrive in ambiguous, fast-moving environments where the hardware, the scale, and the requirements are all changing simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hold a Bachelor&#39;s degree in Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Computer Engineering, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/p&gt;
