&lt;li&gt;Effective collaboration skills for working with business teams who handle transaction management and site selection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in infrastructure development and appreciation for why compute and datacenter capacity is mission-critical for frontier AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
