&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a strategic communications professional to join our team and drive external storytelling for Anthropic&#39;s research and model training work. This role will be the primary external comms partner to our model research and training teams that cover areas like Interpretability and Alignment — some of the most distinctive and technically deep research work happening in AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll craft compelling narratives that make frontier AI research and safety work more accessible and meaningful to journalists, policymakers, the broader research and safety community, and the public.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
