&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is seeking an exceptional Contracts Manager to support commercial and technology transactions. We&#39;ll rely on you to help review, draft, and negotiate commercial and procurement contracts to support our cutting-edge AI systems. You&#39;ll also build scalable contracting processes and collaborate across Product, Sales, Finance, Business Operations, Research, and Procurement teams.&lt;/p&gt;
