&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a strong track record of building scalable operational systems for new programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have run high-touch external programs, executive convenings, or stakeholder engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are comfortable with complex logistics that work across external organizations, internal teams, and executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
