&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience at hyperscalers, large compute consumers, data center operators, or telecommunications companies with exposure to network and data center buildout asset structures (including fiber, routers, switches, electrical infrastructure, cooling, and cable plant)&lt;/p&gt;
