&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp; Analytical mindset with comfort using data to prioritize accounts and identify trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp; Enthusiasm for emerging technologies and genuine interest in AI&lt;/p&gt;
