&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own and maintain team dashboards, recurring content, and reporting infrastructure — keeping them live, accurate, and reconciled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive integration of financial models across the compute finance team into a coherent, full three-statement view&lt;/li&gt;
