&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Run team operating rhythm: meeting agendas, sprint cadence, recurring deliverable tracking, and cross-pillar coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own compute finance&#39;s planning-system footprint — datasets, sources of truth, and pipeline into corporate systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive model hygiene, version control, and central organization of team financial models&lt;/li&gt;
