&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Bias towards action, strong work ethic, and experience driving outcomes under tight timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Passion for Anthropic&#39;s mission to build safe, transformative AI systems&lt;/li&gt;
