&lt;p&gt;Experience at an AI, developer-tools, or API-first company with consumption-based pricing (ideally as well as B2B SaaS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong familiarity with, if not direct experience in, commercial roles (sales, rev ops, product marketing) or product management in addition to operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with safety, trust &amp;amp; safety, or security-review processes in a product context&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
