&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A love of teaching, mentoring, and helping others succeed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a passion for making powerful technology safe and societally beneficial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think creatively about the risks and benefits of new technologies, and think beyond past checklists and playbooks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
