&lt;p&gt;●&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Lead comprehensive User Acceptance Testing (UAT) for new product launches and influence product introduction processes by providing expert guidance on billing and order management implications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;●&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Support monthly accounting close activities, including contract review, usage validation, invoice verification, journal entries, and analytics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;●&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Develop and track operational metrics to support strategic decision-making&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;●&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Support global business operations and international customer requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
