&lt;p&gt;●&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Cultivate strategic partnerships with cross-functional teams across the Quote-to-Cash ecosystem, including GTM, Legal, Tax, Billing Engineering, and Finance Systems&lt;/p&gt;
