&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have product marketing experience focused on developer platforms, APIs, or technical products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a proven track record of developing and executing go-to-market strategies for API products or developer tools, including successful product launches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
