&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building data infrastructure and data foundations for research&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with large language models, AI systems, or ML research workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prior work on projects related to labor economics, technology adoption, or economic measurement&lt;/p&gt;
