&lt;p&gt;Building &amp;amp; maintaining large, foundational infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building simple interfaces that allow non-technical collaborators to evaluate AI systems&lt;/p&gt;
