&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in incident response, reverse engineering, network analysis, penetration testing, or similar fields&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with AI/ML models and building products on top of them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building agentic applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
