&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working directly with researchers, especially in AI safety or machine learning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with the AI safety research landscape, key organizations, and ongoing debates&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
