&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;The Creative Studio is Anthropic’s in-house creative team responsible for the brand expression across Anthropic and Claude. We care about craft, making things by hand and using AI when it makes sense. The team is growing, and we’re looking for people who do excellent work to join us. The stakes are real, and there’s room to shape what all this becomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Video Director for Product Launches at Anthropic, you will own the creative vision and execution of video content for our most important moments: model launches and product reveals. You&#39;ll lead the full production lifecycle from concept to delivery, bringing a storyteller&#39;s instinct to complex technical subjects and crafting narratives that make transformative AI feel accessible and compelling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role operates in a fast-paced environment where launch timelines move quickly and turnarounds are tight. You&#39;ll need to make sharp creative decisions without the luxury of extended development cycles, pivoting when priorities shift, moving from brief to execution with speed, and delivering high-quality work under real pressure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re someone who can walk into a room, understand what a launch needs to communicate, and build a video strategy around it — then execute it at the highest level. You lead crews with confidence, guide collaborators through ambiguity, and know how to get great work across the finish line even when the timeline is short.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Direct and oversee video production for model and product launches, from initial creative brief through final delivery, often on compressed timelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop creative concepts, treatments, and narrative strategies that translate complex AI capabilities into compelling, human-centered stories&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and manage production crews on set, including DPs, camera operators, sound, lighting, and other crew members&lt;/p&gt;
