&lt;li&gt;Identify the story worth telling within a launch, taking raw elements, context, and product details and crafting a cohesive narrative arc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain scalable production processes that can flex to meet the pace of Anthropic&#39;s launch cadence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay current with video production trends, launch formats, and storytelling techniques in the technology and AI space&lt;/p&gt;
